//
// VISIBILITY: PUBLIC, and HELD ("Coming soon") until a NAMED qualified reviewer has read every
// lesson marked QR, and a practitioner or BAM has supplied every lesson marked P, each with authority
// to change or cut it. The publishHoldReason in scripts/seed-courses.ts names the QR hold; the P hold
