//
// WHAT IT IS NOT, said in the description and in lessons 1, 2 and 10: a qualification, an electrical
// course, or a course that teaches anyone to hang, focus or fly a light. It gives no safe distance
// from a lamp, no load arithmetic and no modern illumination target, because no source in the
