      body: "Ten questions drawn from a pool covering the whole course: the functions of light, hard and soft light, shaping light with what the room holds and the fence around it, natural light, key, fill and back, color temperature, the three rooms, and the safety floor. Each answer links back to the lesson that teaches it.",
